You need to collect seven staves of wood. If you can't find them,
just kill enough wood golems. Then you need the Candelabrum. Collect
7 candles, put them in the Candelabrum, then light them. Then use
the Candelabrum to set your wood pile ablaze (if you light your fire
with just candles, you won't get the magic fire necessary to make
the Omelet).

